<div data-type="problem" id="fs-id1171239841445"><div class="os-problem-container">
<p id="fs-id1171242189173">Verify the directions of the induced currents in <a href="13-1-faradays-law" class="autogenerated-content" aria-label="View Figure 13.3" data-page-slug="13-1-faradays-law" data-page-uuid="053645ea-f5f8-4208-9f36-1abc34ff85ee" data-page-fragment="CNX_UPhysics_30_01_Circuit">Figure 13.3</a>.</p>
</div></div>
</section></div>
